# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system 00dfbb036aef976a79c1b65559c03bc41f975c83b8064b74f1fa23e0cf874b5c
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server 17a13343c5f4d3dc3fca27437956bbdfacb3708cfc5f5d40332bbea1fa389fae
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm 8efa26c163631b6845afe43bcbacba06e647004a9ccf12b38cda4df39b890ed6
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xclock 3df22f85dfe193089894dc56885ed4ab4147bd180315ab4e8bd20b2355c5101c
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xeyes 1429596bf46651729ea14f8cbefe513fdf3c88f1553cd19734a5d8b7b1bff813
